====== devolo WiFi pro 1750e ======

The devolo WiFi pro 1750e is a wall mountable access point with:

  * Dual band 2.4 and 5 GHz WiFi (3×3 IEEE 802.11n 450Mbps, 3×3 IEEE 802.11ac 1299Mpbs)
  * 2x 1Gbit ethernet ports (with Power over Ethernet support)
  * 1x USB 2.0 port
  * External serial console port (Currently unsupported but internal 4-pin internal [[https://www.instructables.com/id/Fitting-Dupont-Connectors/|Dupont]] connector is functional)
  * 1x GPIO attached piezo beeper

The access point is manufactured by OEM Acelink Technologies Co., Ltd. as a [[http://www.acelink.com.tw/EW-7679WAC.html|EW-7679WAC]] and was originally sold by Edimax as a [[https://www.edimax.com/edimax/merchandise/merchandise_detail/data/edimax/global/edimax_pro_indoor_access_points_ac1750/wap1750/|WAP1750]]. The Edimax unit was reviewed by [[https://www.smallnetbuilder.com/wireless/wireless-reviews/32667-edimax-wap1750-cap1200-pro-aps-reviewed|SmallNetBuilder]].

