-> [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing|Install OpenWrt (generic explanation)]]

Set a password for the root user as prompted on first set-up of OEM firmware.

  - Upload OpenWrt sysupgrade image via SSH to the device. Use /tmp as the destination folder on the device. User is root, password previously set in the web interface.
  - Install OpenWrt with:<code>sysupgrade -n -F /tmp/<openwrt-image-name></code>
  - Connect to LAN 2 (poe)


